          "section": "Abstract",
          "quote": "Here we introduce a new ‘phase-transformation strengthening’ mechanism that resists high-temperature creep deformation in nickel-based superalloys, where speciﬁc alloying elements inhibit the deleterious deformation mode of nanotwinning at temperatures above 700 /C176C.",
